，有aldente 既感覺，四川麻辣醬汁同意粉好夾，每一啖都係味蕾既沖擊，濃烈既川麻味香係舌尖炸開。當然花膠亦","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0u0zVW1"},{"full":"https://static8.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/33/2GB3/0HFYZJ29F58DDD9856F58Apx.webp","time":"2026-08-07T14:07:22+08:00","caption":"意大利魷魚既特色就係鮮味出，唔需要特別既醬汁都可以好食， 呢個蕃紅花泡沫避左汁味重，只係幫主角輕輕咁提鮮，個人建議唔加泡沫就咁食先，感受純意大利鱿魚既鮮味。 #","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0tmzVW1"},{"full":"https://static7.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/33/2GB3/0HFYZIC6B2DA6401B6918Fpx.webp","time":"2026-08-07T14:07:22+08:00","caption":"一打開個蓋，清香既蘋果木煙燻味就擁過黎，燉蛋既味道做到好細緻同滑，每 一啖都夾住野菌既甘甜味。 #香港美食 #FoodieLife #DiningExperie","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0tWzVW1"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/33/2GB3/0HFYZH091ECC41D9F97CE1px.webp","time":"2026-08-07T14:07:22+08:00","caption":"呢味菜既呈現方式係先係大根會上碟先，濃湯再後加。 未加湯前大根已經有淡淡既清香，濃湯帶煮好重味既大根味，再試一口大根，就食到另一種清新既味道，做到以濃襯清既效果","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0tGzVW1"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/33/2GB3/0HFYZG9A6D108884BB0228px.webp","time":"2026-08-07T14:07:22+08:00","caption":"蟶子比一般有男士手掌大，慢煮既方式令到蟶子肉望上去係有透明既感覺，咁樣可以保持蟶子既鮮味同時避免蟶子肉因為overcook 而令到肉質變韌。 蟶子肉均勻咁切開左","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0t0zVW1"},{"full":"https://static8.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/33/2GB3/0HFYZFB8361F226E54D75Epx.webp","time":"2026-08-07T14:07:22+08:00","caption":"淡淡既蕃茄泡沫，搭上味道濃烈既burrata cheese , 帶俾味蕾由酸甜到乳新鮮乳制品既酸意，展現到味道既一致性。而且本來蕃茄同burruta chees","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0smzVW1"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/32/2FL4/0HAUB8DB07E2517D40BE24px.webp","time":"2026-07-01T12:12:00+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0yZHTW1"},{"full":"https://static8.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/32/2FL4/0HAUB74E99F19E66241C3Apx.webp","time":"2026-07-01T12:12:00+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0yRHTW1"},{"full":"https://static7.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/32/2FL4/0HAUB66AC7850CC3293C85px.webp","time":"2026-07-01T12:12:00+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0yJHTW1"},{"full":"https://static